// Generated by the take estate pass from the base map's own SP path nodes
// (mp_estate_tropical.ff map entities: node_pathnode / node_cover_* /
// node_exposed origins).  No compiled path links ship, so a link is any
// pair of nodes within 260 units across and a climb the slope allows;
// _coopmission_estate.gsc checks each link it uses with traces at run time.
// Only the nodes on or beside the routes between the mission's own points
// (the landing, Ghost's colour nodes, the house, the basement, the chase)
// are kept.  Regenerate rather than hand edit.

